 "title": "Merge intervals",
 "short": "Sort ranges by start, then glue together the ones that overlap.",
 "what": "You get ranges like meetings: [start, end]. Sort them by start. Then walk through them keeping one open block: if the next range starts before the block ends, they overlap, so stretch the block. If it starts after, close the block and open a new one.",
